  {t="Target: Gahrron's Withering", lv=59, n="Back east past the Writhing Haunt to Gahrron's Withering, the farm under the eastern hills: Cauldron Lord Soulwrath guards its cauldron. Kill him for the key, then use the cauldron.", g={{"o",5235,i=1,txt="Gahrron's Withering Cauldron Key",m=1422,x=62.2,y=59.1},{"t",5235,m=1422,x=62.5,y=58.5},{"a",5236,m=1422,x=62.5,y=58.5,ml=50}}},
