  {t="Scuttle Coast: kill these as you meet them", lv=6, n="Makrura and surf crawlers line the beaches north-east of Sen'jin; the Taillasher eggs sit in nests along the beach.\nThe gnomish toolboxes lie in the wreckage along the shore east and south-east of Razor Hill. Follow the shore south to Sen'jin.", g={{"o",825,i=1,txt="Gnomish Tools x3",n2="Underwater",m=1411,x=61.9,y=42.4},{"o",818,i=2,txt="Crawler Mucus x8",m=1411,x=60.3,y=43.3},{"o",818,i=1,txt="Intact Makrura Eye x4",n2="Underwater",m=1411,x=61.1,y=42.5},{"o",815,i=1,txt="Taillasher Egg x3",m=1411,x=67.8,y=69.8}}},
  {t="Bloodtalon Matriarch", lv=6, n="Wade across to the northern Echo Isle. The Matriarch prowls among the raptors there; Durotar Tigers roam the isle and the shore south of Sen'jin.", g={{"o",97223,i=1,txt="Bloodtalon Matriarch Eggs",m=1411,x=68.8,y=71.8},{"o",817,i=1,txt="Durotar Tiger Fur x4",m=1411,x=69,y=72.4}}},
  {t="Echo Isles: kill these as you meet them", lv=6, n="Head south through the isles. The Loa idols lie all over the southern isles; Voodoo and Hexed Trolls hold them and drop the Hexed Pendants. Zalazane and Minshina's cage are on the southernmost isle.\nWade back west to the shore south of Sen'jin when the isles are done.", g={{"c",96873,txt="Luminous Residue",opt=true},{"o",826,i=2,txt="Kill Voodoo Troll x8",m=1411,x=67.8,y=82.1},{"o",826,i=1,txt="Kill Hexed Troll x8",m=1411,x=68.3,y=83.2},{"o",97225,i=1,txt="Forgotten Loa Idol x8",m=1411,x=68.3,y=83.7},{"o",826,i=3,txt="Zalazane's Head",m=1411,x=67.5,y=87.8},{"o",808,i=1,txt="Minshina's Skull",m=1411,x=67.4,y=87.8}}},
  {t="Sen'jin Village", lv=6, g={{"t",96873,m=1411,x=56.7,y=73.7,opt=true},{"t",817,m=1411,x=56,y=73.9},{"t",818,m=1411,x=55.9,y=74.4},{"t",826,m=1411,x=56,y=74.7},{"t",808,m=1411,x=56,y=74.7},{"t",97225,m=1411,x=56,y=74.7},{"t",97223,m=1411,x=55.3,y=75.5},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="Un'Thuwa, the mage trainer in Sen'jin",f={c={"MAGE"}}}}},
  {t="Kolkar Crag", lv=6, n="Kolkar Crag lies west of Sen'jin. The three attack plans sit on the ground among the centaur tents. Pal'juh is held at the crag as well.", g={{"a",99123,m=1411,x=46.3,y=78.7,ml=4},{"g",0,txt="Kolkar Crag",n2="Free Pal'juh and see her safely out of the crag",m=1411,x=46.3,y=78.7},{"c",99123,txt="Escort Pal'juh out of Kolkar Crag."},{"o",786,i=3,txt="Attack Plan: Orgrimmar",m=1411,x=46.2,y=78.9},{"o",786,i=2,txt="Attack Plan: Sen'jin Village",m=1411,x=47.7,y=77.3},{"o",786,i=1,txt="Attack Plan: Valley of Trials",m=1411,x=49.8,y=81.3}}},
  {t="Sen'jin Village", lv=6, g={{"t",786,m=1411,x=54.4,y=74.3},{"t",99123,m=1411,x=55.9,y=74.4}}},
  {t="Razor Hill", lv=9, g={{"a",99048,m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1,ml=9},{"a",837,m=1411,x=52,y=43.5,ml=6},{"t",825,m=1411,x=52,y=43.5},{"t",815,m=1411,x=51.1,y=42.5}}},
  {t="Level 10", lv=10, n="Top up here to level 10: Conscript of the Horde, at Razor Hill, needs level 10.", w={{k="level",op="<",n=10}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Razormane Quilboar",m=1411,x=50.1,y=49},{"l",10,txt="Reach level 10: grind Razormane Quilboar",n2="grind on Razormane Quilboar",m=1411,x=50.2,y=49.6}}},
  {t="Razor Hill", lv=10, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",f={c={"WARRIOR","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","WARLOCK"}}},{"a",840,m=1411,x=50.8,y=43.6,ml=10},{"a",1505,n2="Tarshaw Jaggedscar, inside",m=1411,x=54.2,y=42.5,f={c={"WARRIOR"}},ml=10},{"a",6062,m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}},ml=10},{"a",1506,n2="Ophek, by the inn",m=1411,x=54.4,y=41.3,f={c={"WARLOCK"}},ml=10},{"a",5654,n2="Tai'jin, for Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar: keep it",m=1411,x=54.3,y=42.9,f={c={"PRIEST"},r={"Troll"}},ml=10},{"a",2983,m=1411,x=54.4,y=42.6,f={c={"SHAMAN"}},ml=10}}},
  {t="Far Watch Post", lv=10, n="West over the Southfury River bridge: Kargal Battlescar stands at Far Watch Post above it, on your way to Kranal Fiss.", f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"t",840,m=1413,x=62.3,y=19.4}}},
  {t="The Barrens", lv=10, f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Kranal Fiss",m=1413,x=56,y=19.9}}},
  {t="", lv=10, w={{k="onquest",q={1522}}}, f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"t",1522,m=1413,x=56,y=19.9}}},
  {t="", lv=10, w={{k="onquest",q={1523}}}, f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"t",1523,m=1413,x=56,y=19.9}}},
  {t="", lv=10, w={{k="onquest",q={2984}}}, f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"t",2984,m=1413,x=56,y=19.9}}},
  {t="Kranal Fiss", lv=10, n="West over the Southfury River bridge, past Far Watch Post and on along the ridge: Kranal Fiss stands alone above the Razormane camp.", f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"t",2983,m=1413,x=56,y=19.9},{"a",1524,m=1413,x=56,y=19.9,ml=10}}},
  {t="Telf Joolam", lv=10, n="Back over the bridge and south along the Durotar bank of the river to where a narrow trail climbs the mountain: Telf keeps the shrine at the top. Mind the edges on the way up, and come back down the same trail.", f={c={"SHAMAN"}}, g={{"t",1524,m=1411,x=38.5,y=59},{"a",1525,m=1411,x=38.5,y=59,ml=10}}},
  {t="Razormane Grounds", lv=10, n="Quilboars and scouts hold the huts west of town; dustrunners and battleguards hold the camps farther west.", g={{"o",837,i=1,txt="Kill Razormane Quilboar x4",m=1411,x=43.2,y=50.6},{"o",837,i=2,txt="Kill Razormane Scout x4",m=1411,x=43.2,y=50.4},{"o",837,i=3,txt="Kill Razormane Dustrunner x4",m=1411,x=39.4,y=52.4},{"o",837,i=4,txt="Kill Razormane Battleguard x4",m=1411,x=39.4,y=52.4}}},
  {t="Rezlak", lv=10, n="Head north-east to the road toward Orgrimmar. Rezlak camps beside it; the stolen sacks lie along the road south of him.", g={{"a",834,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9,ml=7},{"o",834,i=1,txt="Sack of Supplies x5",m=1411,x=49.1,y=22.6},{"t",834,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9},{"a",835,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9,ml=7}}},
  {t="Drygulch Ravine", lv=10, n="Savages and Storm Witches nest in Drygulch Ravine, east of Rezlak. A Storm Witch drops the Dull Storm Orb. Shamans: the Burning Blade Cultists by Dustwind Cave, at the ravine's south end, drop the Reagent Pouch.", g={{"o",835,i=1,txt="Kill Dustwind Savage x12",m=1411,x=51.4,y=20.9},{"o",835,i=2,txt="Kill Dustwind Storm Witch x8",m=1411,x=51.3,y=20.2},{"h",277661,txt="Get Dull Storm Orb",m=1411,x=51.3,y=20.2,n=1,opt=true},{"a",97281,opt=true,ml=7},{"o",1525,i=2,txt="Reagent Pouch",m=1411,x=52.2,y=24.5,f={c={"SHAMAN"}}}}},
  {t="Deathskip to Northern Durotar", lv=10, n="Die to the mobs at 52.0,21.4 (Dustwind Storm Witch): a death there sends you to this graveyard. Release your spirit and take the Spirit Healer's resurrection.", g={{"z",0,txt="Die and resurrect at Northern Durotar",m=1411,x=47.4,y=17.9,at="Northern Durotar"}}},
  {t="Rezlak", lv=10, g={{"t",835,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9},{"t",97281,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9,opt=true},{"a",97282,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9,opt=true,ml=6}}},
  {t="Thunder Ridge: kill these as you meet them", lv=10, n="Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge, just west and south-west of Rezlak.\nFizzle holds the Burning Blade camp on Thunder Ridge, north-west of Razor Hill. Hunters: tame a Dire Mottled Boar with the Taming Rod on the way.\nCareful: Burning Blade cultists surround Fizzle, some linked so they aggro in pairs, and they respawn quickly.\nCareful: Halikor, a level 12 elite, roams Thunder Ridge among the lizards: watch for him before you pull.", g={{"o",97282,i=1,txt="Charged Thunder Lizard Organ x5",m=1411,x=43.6,y=24.1},{"o",6062,i=1,txt="Tame Dire Mottled Boar",n2="Tame it with the Taming Rod",m=1411,x=42,y=31.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}}},{"o",806,i=1,txt="Fizzle's Claw",m=1411,x=42.1,y=26.7}}},
  {t="Misha Tor'kren", lv=10, n="Misha's hut stands south of the lizards. The crocolisks along the Southfury River to the west carry Kron's Amulet.", g={{"a",816,n2="Inside",m=1411,x=43.1,y=30.2,ml=8},{"o",816,i=1,txt="Kron's Amulet",m=1411,x=35.2,y=30.1},{"t",816,m=1411,x=43.1,y=30.2}}},
  {t="Rezlak", lv=10, g={{"t",97282,m=1411,x=46.4,y=22.9}}},
  {t="Heglan Shadeeye", lv=10, n="Heglan stands on the shore east of Razor Hill. The trident, banner and dagger lie on the beach around him.", g={{"t",99048,m=1411,x=58.6,y=45.6},{"a",99049,m=1411,x=58.6,y=45.6,ml=8},{"o",99049,i=1,txt="Orcish Dagger",m=1411,x=58.9,y=44.4},{"o",99049,i=3,txt="Broken Bone Trident",m=1411,x=60.1,y=44.8},{"o",99049,i=2,txt="Banner Scrap",m=1411,x=60.1,y=42.4}}},
  {t="Class trainer", lv=10, f={c={"WARRIOR","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","WARLOCK"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",f={c={"WARRIOR","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","WARLOCK"}}}}},
  {t="Paladin trainer", lv=10, f={c={"PALADIN"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="Alodan the Hopeful in Thunder Bluff; Razor Hill has no paladin trainer",f={c={"PALADIN"}}}}},
  {t="Mage trainer", lv=10, f={c={"MAGE"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="Mai'ah in Durotar; Razor Hill has no mage trainer",f={c={"MAGE"}}}}},
  {t="Druid trainer", lv=10, f={c={"DRUID"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="Sheal Runetotem in Mulgore; Razor Hill has no druid trainer",f={c={"DRUID"}}}}},
  {t="Razor Hill", lv=10, n="Back to Razor Hill: Gar'Thok, then Orgnil.", g={{"t",837,m=1411,x=52,y=43.5},{"t",6062,m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}}},{"a",6083,m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}},ml=10},{"t",806,m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1},{"a",828,m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1,ml=4},{"t",99049,m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1},{"a",99051,m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1,ml=8},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",f={c={"WARRIOR","HUNTER","ROGUE","PRIEST","SHAMAN","WARLOCK"}}}}},
  {t="Spitelash naga", lv=10, n="North-east to the beach below Drygulch Ravine, north of Heglan: Spitelash Scouts and Attendants hold it. Hunters: tame a Surf Crawler on the beach.", g={{"o",99051,i=1,txt="Naga Spinefin x9",m=1411,x=58.9,y=27},{"o",6083,i=1,txt="Tame Surf Crawler",n2="Tame it with the Taming Rod",m=1411,x=58.9,y=28.3,f={c={"HUNTER"}}}}},
  {t="Margoz", lv=10, n="Margoz camps on the hill west of the naga beach, south of Skull Rock.", g={{"t",828,m=1411,x=56.4,y=20},{"a",827,m=1411,x=56.4,y=20,ml=4}}},
  {t="Orgrimmar", lv=10, f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Gan'rul Bloodeye",m=1454,x=48.3,y=45.3}}},
  {t="Gan'rul Bloodeye", lv=10, n="Orgrimmar's main gate is just west of Skull Rock. Gan'rul stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength.", f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"t",1506,m=1454,x=48.2,y=45.3},{"a",1501,m=1454,x=48.2,y=45.3,ml=10}}},
  {t="Hanashi", lv=10, n="While you're here: learn Staves from Hanashi (Valley of Honor, 10 silver); a staff carries more spell stats than a one-hander while you level.", w={{k="money",op=">=",n=1000},{k="skill",neg=true,n=1,name="Staves",skillLine=136}}, f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Train with Hanashi",m=1454,x=81.5,y=19.6}}},
  {t="Back to Durotar", lv=10, f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Skull Rock",m=1411,x=53.1,y=9.4}}},
  {t="Skull Rock's mouth", lv=10, g={{"g",0,txt="Skull Rock",m=1411,x=55,y=10}}},
  {t="Skull Rock", lv=10, n="Burning Blade cultists hold the caves of Skull Rock; any of them drops a Searing Collar. Gazz'uz, a level 14 warlock, stands deep inside and drops the Eye of Burning Shadow.", g={{"o",827,i=1,txt="Searing Collar x6",n2="Below ground",m=1411,x=55,y=9.8},{"h",4903,txt="Get Eye of Burning Shadow",n2="Below ground",m=1411,x=52.6,y=8.8,n=1},{"a",832,ml=4}}},
  {t="Tablet of Verga", lv=10, n="The Burning Blade Stash stands in Skull Rock, among the cultists you just fought.", f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"o",1501,i=1,txt="Tablet of Verga",m=1411,x=51.6,y=9.8}}},
  {t="Margoz", lv=10, g={{"t",827,m=1411,x=56.4,y=20},{"a",829,m=1411,x=56.4,y=20,ml=4}}},
  {t="Razor Hill", lv=10, n="Back to Razor Hill.", g={{"t",99051,m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1},{"t",6083,m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}}},{"a",6082,m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5,f={c={"HUNTER"}},ml=10}}},
  {t="Razor Hill", lv=10, w={{k="group",q=99052}}, g={{"a",99052,n2="Orgnil Soulscar: Aggor the Young, an elite sea giant",m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1,ml=10}}},
  {t="Aggor the Young", lv=10, n="Aggor the Young, a young sea giant, walks Durotar's north coast, north of the naga beach. Aggor the Young is elite: grouping up is advised.", w={{k="group",q=99052}}, g={{"o",99052,i=1,txt="Aggor's Belt",m=1411,x=59.2,y=17.6,grp=true},{"t",99052,n2="Orgnil Soulscar, back in Razor Hill",m=1411,x=52.2,y=43.1}}},
  {t="Armored Scorpid", lv=10, n="Armored Scorpids crawl over the plains west of Razor Hill. Tame one, then return to Thotar.", f={c={"HUNTER"}}, g={{"o",6082,i=1,txt="Tame Armored Scorpid",n2="Tame it with the Taming Rod",m=1411,x=51,y=37.7},{"t",6082,n2="Thotar: Tame Beast",m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5},{"a",6081,n2="Thotar: Ormak Grimshot in Orgrimmar teaches Beast Training",m=1411,x=51.9,y=43.5,ml=10}}},
  {t="Far Watch Post", lv=10, n="West from Razor Hill over the Southfury River bridge: Kargal Battlescar and Uzzek stand together at Far Watch Post above it. From there the road north through Durotar leads to Orgrimmar.", w={{k="onquest",q={840}}}, g={{"t",840,m=1413,x=62.3,y=19.4},{"t",1505,m=1413,x=61.4,y=21.1,f={c={"WARRIOR"}}},{"a",1498,m=1413,x=61.4,y=21.1,f={c={"WARRIOR"}},ml=10}}},
  {t="Thunder lizards on the way north", lv=10, n="Thunder Lizards and Lightning Hides graze on Thunder Ridge, beside the road north to Orgrimmar; any of them can drop a Singed Scale. Uzzek takes it when the next guide passes Far Watch Post.\nCareful: Halikor, a level 12 elite, roams Thunder Ridge among the lizards: watch for him before you pull.", f={c={"WARRIOR"}}, g={{"o",1498,i=1,txt="Singed Scale x5",m=1411,x=39.7,y=29.2}}},
  {t="Orgrimmar", lv=10, f={c={"HUNTER"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Ormak Grimshot",m=1454,x=66,y=18.5}}},
  {t="Ormak Grimshot", lv=10, n="Follow the road north from Far Watch Post to Orgrimmar's main gate, just west of Skull Rock. Ormak Grimshot stands with the hunter trainers in the Valley of Honor.", f={c={"HUNTER"}}, g={{"t",6081,n2="Ormak Grimshot: Beast Training",m=1454,x=66,y=18.5}}},
  {t="Hanashi", lv=10, n="While you're here: learn Staves from Hanashi (Valley of Honor, 10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.", w={{k="money",op=">=",n=1000},{k="skill",neg=true,n=1,name="Staves",skillLine=136}}, f={c={"HUNTER"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Train with Hanashi",m=1454,x=81.5,y=19.6}}},
  {t="To Orgrimmar", lv=10, n="Follow the road north from Far Watch Post to Orgrimmar's main gate. The next guide starts in Orgrimmar: Neeru Fireblade takes the cultists' quest, the trainers teach your new ranks, and the zeppelin leaves from the towers outside the gate for Tirisfal Glades and Silverpine Forest. The Barrens come after Silverpine.", g={{"g",0,txt="Orgrimmar's Valley of Strength",m=1454,x=55.6,y=72.3}}},
  {t="The Binding", lv=10, n="Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Hand him the Tablet of Verga, then use the Glyphs of Summoning on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker to bind it.", f={c={"WARLOCK"}}, g={{"t",1501,m=1454,x=48.2,y=45.3},{"a",1504,m=1454,x=48.2,y=45.3,ml=10},{"i",0,txt="Use Glyphs of Summoning",m=1454,x=49.3,y=50},{"o",1504,i=1,txt="Kill Summoned Voidwalker",m=1454,x=49.3,y=50},{"t",1504,n2="Gan'rul Bloodeye: Summon Voidwalker",m=1454,x=48.2,y=45.3}}},
} end)

R:Segment({id="horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades",title="Tirisfal Glades",faction="Horde",races={"Scourge"},min=1,max=13,zone=1420,zoneName="Tirisfal Glades",next="horde/03-silverpine-forest"}, function() return {
  {t="Undertaker Mordo", lv=1, n="You rise in the crypt at the south end of Deathknell. Undertaker Mordo waits just outside.", g={{"a",363,m=1420,x=30.2,y=71.7,ml=1}}},
  {t="Shadow Priest Sarvis", lv=1, n="Follow the path north into Deathknell; Sarvis stands in front of the church.", g={{"t",363,n2="Inside",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2},{"a",364,m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,ml=1},{"a",1470,m=1420,x=31,y=66.4,f={c={"WARLOCK"}},ml=1}}},
  {t="Mindless Zombies", lv=1, n="The zombies shamble around the graveyard and the houses just east of the church.", g={{"o",364,i=1,txt="Kill Mindless Zombie x8",m=1420,x=30.7,y=64.2},{"o",364,i=2,txt="Kill Wretched Zombie x8",m=1420,x=30.3,y=63.3}}},
  {t="Shadow Priest Sarvis", lv=2, g={{"t",364,n2="Inside",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2},{"a",3901,m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,ml=1},{"a",3095,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis: Simple Scroll",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,f={c={"WARRIOR"}},ml=1},{"a",3096,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis: Encrypted Scroll",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,f={c={"ROGUE"}},ml=1},{"a",3097,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis: Hallowed Scroll",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,f={c={"PRIEST"}},ml=1},{"a",3098,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis: Glyphic Scroll",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,f={c={"MAGE"}},ml=1},{"a",3099,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis: Tainted Scroll",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,f={c={"WARLOCK"}},ml=1},{"a",98601,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis: the scroll for Aramis",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2,f={c={"PALADIN"}},ml=1},{"a",376,n2="Novice Elreth, beside the church; inside",m=1420,x=30.9,y=66,ml=2},{"t",3095,n2="Dannal Stern, the warrior trainer; inside",m=1420,x=32.7,y=65.6,f={c={"WARRIOR"}}},{"t",3096,n2="David Trias, the rogue trainer",m=1420,x=32.5,y=65.7,f={c={"ROGUE"}}},{"t",3097,n2="Dark Cleric Duesten, the priest trainer in the church",m=1420,x=31.1,y=66,f={c={"PRIEST"}}},{"t",3098,n2="Isabella, the mage trainer, in the church",m=1420,x=30.9,y=66.1,f={c={"MAGE"}}},{"t",3099,n2="Maximillion, the warlock trainer",m=1420,x=30.9,y=66.3,f={c={"WARLOCK"}}},{"t",98601,m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,f={c={"PALADIN"}}},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer",n2="The Deathknell trainers stand around the church"},{"a",90902,m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,f={c={"PALADIN"}},ml=2}}},
  {t="Injured Deathguard", lv=2, n="Rediscovering the Light: the Injured Deathguard lie around the church. Heal five of them with Holy Light.", f={c={"PALADIN"}}, g={{"g",0,txt="Injured Deathguard",m=1420,x=31.6,y=65.8},{"c",90902,txt="Heal 5 Injured Deathguard"}}},
  {t="Deathknell: kill these as you meet them", lv=2, n="Rattlecage Skeletons wander the ruined houses in the north half of Deathknell. Young Scavengers and Duskbats roam all around the village; the Ragged Scavengers and Mangy Duskbats are on its east side. Novice Elreth wants their paws and wings: kill them as you meet them while you clear the skeletons.", g={{"o",3901,i=1,txt="Kill Rattlecage Skeleton x12",m=1420,x=33,y=63},{"o",1470,i=1,txt="Rattlecage Skull x3",m=1420,x=33,y=63,f={c={"WARLOCK"}}},{"o",376,i=1,txt="Scavenger Paw x6",m=1420,x=34.6,y=62.5},{"o",376,i=2,txt="Duskbat Wing x6",m=1420,x=33.9,y=61.7}}},
  {t="Back to the church", lv=3, g={{"t",376,n2="Novice Elreth, inside",m=1420,x=30.9,y=66},{"t",90902,n2="Aramis Hammerhand: Holy Light, once five Injured Deathguard are healed",m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,f={c={"PALADIN"}}},{"t",1470,n2="Venya Marthand: Summon Imp",m=1420,x=31,y=66.4,f={c={"WARLOCK"}}},{"a",6395,m=1420,x=30.9,y=66,ml=3},{"t",3901,n2="Shadow Priest Sarvis, inside",m=1420,x=30.8,y=66.2},{"a",98389,n2="Aramis Hammerhand, inside",m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,ml=2},{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer"},{"a",3902,m=1420,x=31.6,y=65.6,ml=2},{"a",380,n2="Executor Arren, in the church",m=1420,x=32.1,y=66,ml=2}}},
  {t="Scavenging Deathknell", lv=3, n="The Equipment Boxes lie beside the ruined houses in the north of Deathknell.", g={{"o",3902,i=1,txt="Scavenged Goods x6",m=1420,x=33,y=65.4}}},
  {t="Back to Deathknell", lv=4, g={{"t",3902,m=1420,x=31.6,y=65.6},{"a",91208,m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,f={c={"PALADIN"}},ml=4}}},
  {t="The Frightened Paladin", lv=4, n="Coming to Terms: the Frightened Paladin fled into the hills west of the church, on the way to Night Web's Hollow.", f={c={"PALADIN"}}, g={{"tk",246143,txt="Talk to Frightened Paladin",n2="Offer aid to the Frightened Paladin",m=1420,x=27.7,y=63.8}}},
  {t="Night Web's Hollow", lv=4, n="Head west to the cave. The Young Night Web Spiders sit outside; the Night Web Spiders and the cocooned Webbed Forsaken are inside.\nCareful: A low-level character can die quickly if it pulls several Night Web Spiders in the cave at the same time.", g={{"o",380,i=1,txt="Kill Young Night Web Spider x10",m=1420,x=27.9,y=60.5},{"o",380,i=2,txt="Kill Night Web Spider x8",n2="Below ground",m=1420,x=26.6,y=59.5},{"g",0,txt="Night Web's Hollow",m=1420,x=26,y=60},{"o",98389,i=1,txt="Free the Webbed Forsaken x6",n2="attack the cocoons inside the cave to free them; below ground",m=1420,x=26.2,y=60.2}}},
  {t="Back to Deathknell", lv=4, g={{"t",98389,n2="Aramis Hammerhand, inside",m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4},{"t",91208,m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,f={c={"PALADIN"}}},{"a",91209,m=1420,x=31.1,y=66.4,f={c={"PALADIN"}},ml=4},{"t",380,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66},{"a",381,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66,ml=2}}},
  {t="The Scarlet farm", lv=4, n="The Scarlet Converts and Initiates hold the farm east of Deathknell. Samuel Fipps wanders between the farmhouses: his remains are for Marla's Last Wish.", g={{"o",381,i=1,txt="Scarlet Armband x12",m=1420,x=35.9,y=68.6},{"h",16333,txt="Get Samuel's Remains",n2="Samuel's Remains, from Samuel Fipps",m=1420,x=36.7,y=61.6,n=1}}},
  {t="Marla's Grave", lv=4, n="Marla's Grave is in the Deathknell graveyard, beside the church.", g={{"o",6395,i=1,txt="Marla's Grave",m=1420,x=31.2,y=65.1}}},
  {t="Executor Arren", lv=4, g={{"t",6395,n2="Novice Elreth, inside",m=1420,x=30.9,y=66},{"t",381,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66},{"a",382,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66,ml=2}}},
  {t="Meven Korgal", lv=4, n="Meven Korgal stands at the south end of the Scarlet farm.\nCareful: He is flanked by two Scarlet guards, one a convert and the other an initiate, who may join the fight.", g={{"o",382,i=1,txt="Scarlet Crusade Documents",m=1420,x=36.6,y=68.5}}},
  {t="Executor Arren", lv=4, g={{"t",382,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66},{"a",383,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66,ml=2},{"a",96656,m=1420,x=32.1,y=66,ml=4}}},
  {t="Dark Cleric Duesten", lv=5, n="Dark Cleric Duesten, the priest trainer in the church, sends you to Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill. Train Lesser Heal (Rank 2) from him now: the wounded guard Beryl sends you to needs it.", f={c={"PRIEST"}}, g={{"tr",0,txt="Visit your class trainer"},{"a",5651,n2="Dark Cleric Duesten: for Dark Cleric Beryl in Brill",m=1420,x=31.1,y=66,ml=5}}},
  {t="Solliden Farmstead", lv=5, n="Leave Deathknell by the road north-east. Calvin Montague stands by the farmhouse at the Solliden Farmstead; Deathguard Simmer stands by the road just past it.", g={{"a",8,m=1420,x=38.2,y=56.8,ml=1},{"a",365,m=1420,x=40.9,y=54.2,ml=4}}},
  {t="Tirisfal Pumpkins", lv=5, n="The pumpkins grow in the Scarlet-held fields just north-west of the farmhouse.\nCareful: Farmers stand close to the pumpkins, so you can pull more than one at once. Scarlet mobs are found around the edges of the farm and a bit to the northwest.", g={{"o",365,i=1,txt="Tirisfal Pumpkin x10",m=1420,x=37.2,y=52.2}}},
  {t="Gordo", lv=5, n="Gordo, the big abomination, walks the road from here east past Cold Hearth Manor almost to Brill, and back: if he isn't at the arrow, follow the road east until you meet him. The Gloom Weed grows along the road around him.", g={{"a",5481,m=1420,x=43.1,y=54.7,ml=5},{"o",5481,i=1,txt="Gloom Weed x3",m=1420,x=43.1,y=54.7}}},
  {t="Deathguard Dillinger", lv=5, n="Deathguard Dillinger and Deathguard Bartholomew stand at the west end of Brill, where the road from Solliden comes in.", g={{"a",404,m=1420,x=58.2,y=51.5,ml=4},{"a",86784,n2="Deathguard Bartholomew, beside Dillinger",m=1420,x=58.5,y=51.4,ml=4}}},
  {t="Junior Apothecary Holland", lv=5, n="Holland walks around the north side of Brill, a few steps from Dillinger.", g={{"t",5481,n2="Junior Apothecary Holland walks around Brill: look inside the circle on the map",m=1420,x=57.4,y=48.9},{"a",5482,m=1420,x=57.4,y=48.9,ml=5}}},
  {t="Dry Branches", lv=5, n="The Dry Branches lie on the ground around the south-west edge of Brill.", g={{"o",86784,i=1,txt="Dry Branch x6",m=1420,x=56.5,y=53.5}}},
  {t="Eleanor Shackleton", lv=5, n="Eleanor camps just south-west of town. With a profession learned, she also offers its Camping 101, which its trainer takes: in Brill, at Linnea's camp, or in the Undercity in the next guide.", g={{"t",96656,m=1420,x=57.3,y=55.5},{"a",96607,m=1420,x=57.3,y=55.5,ml=4},{"c",96607,txt="Sit near the campfire (Optional); Gain the Boosted Rest buff",n2="/sit by her campfire until you get Boosted Rest",m=1420,x=57.2,y=55.5},{"t",96607,m=1420,x=57.3,y=55.5},{"a",96658,m=1420,x=57.3,y=55.5,ml=4},{"t",86784,m=1420,x=57.3,y=55.5}}},
